@startuml seq-uc03
' Figure 5.2.2 Analysis sequence diagram for UC-03 Save a Favorite Recipe
' Numbered messages match the scenario table rows in 5.2.2 (b). Dashed returns carry no number.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
}
hide footbox
actor User
participant "RecipePanel" as RP
participant "FavoritesList" as FL
participant ":Favorite" as F

User -> RP : 1 asks to save the displayed recipe
activate RP
RP -> FL : 2 asks whether the user already\nhas this recipe as a favorite
FL --> RP : not yet saved
RP -> F ** : 3 creates a favorite with the date saved
RP -> FL : 4 adds the favorite to the user's favorites
RP -> User : 5 confirms the recipe is now a favorite
deactivate RP
@enduml
